---
---
<section id="tjenester" class="bg-neutral-light py-24 px-6 md:px-12">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-brand-blue tracking-tight mb-4">Våre Tjenester</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl text-lg">Tung teknisk kompetanse pakket inn i en strukturert og fremtidsrettet leveransemodell.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="md:col-span-2 group relative rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-accent/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(238,150,75,0.08)] flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-6 right-6 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-accent opacity-30 shadow-[0_0_10px_#EE964B] transition-all group-hover:scale-150 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-accent uppercase tracking-widest bg-brand-orange/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Infrastruktur</span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-blue mt-4 mb-3">Skyarkitektur & Moderne Endpoint Management</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">Vi designer, migrerer og optimaliserer skytjenester og virksomhetskritisk infrastruktur. Med fokus på automasjon, sikkerhet og skalerbarhet sørger vi for at din digitale grunnmur er rigget for fremtiden.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 h-1 w-12 bg-brand-blue rounded-full transition-all group-hover:w-24 group-hover:bg-brand-accent"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-orange/50 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(244,211,94,0.08)] flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="absolute top-6 right-6 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-orange opacity-30 shadow-[0_0_10px_#F4D35E] transition-all group-hover:scale-150 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-blue uppercase tracking-widest bg-brand-blue/5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Data</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-blue mt-4 mb-3">Dataintegrasjon & Analyse</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Vi samler og strukturerer data fra spredte kilder, slik at virksomheten kan ta beslutninger basert på sanntidsinnsikt i stedet for magefølelse.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 h-1 w-12 bg-brand-blue rounded-full transition-all group-hover:w-20 group-hover:bg-brand-orange"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-blue/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(13,59,102,0.05)] flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="absolute top-6 right-6 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-blue opacity-20 shadow-[0_0_10px_#0D3B66] transition-all group-hover:scale-150 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Strategi</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-blue mt-4 mb-3">IT-Rådgivning & Arkitektur</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Strategisk rådgivning som fungerer som brobygger mellom komplekse forretningsmål og den faktiske teknologiske gjennomføringen.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 h-1 w-12 bg-slate-300 rounded-full transition-all group-hover:w-20 group-hover:bg-brand-blue"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-2 group relative rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-brand-blue p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(13,59,102,0.12)] flex flex-col justify-between text-white overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#808080_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#808080_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:24px_24px]"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-orange uppercase tracking-widest bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Kode & Effektivitet</span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-4 mb-3">Automatisering & DevOps Pipelines</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">Vi fjerner repeterende oppgaver og manuelle feilkilder gjennom skreddersydde skript (PowerShell/Bash) og moderne CI/CD-løsninger. Infrastruktur som kode (IaC) sikrer konsistente miljøer hver eneste gang.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 h-1 w-12 bg-brand-orange rounded-full transition-all group-hover:w-24 relative z-10"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
